  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eConvert seconds to days.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18347\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18348\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18349\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18350\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18351\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q0.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18352\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q0.gif\"\u003e on your calculator. To convert from seconds to days, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18353\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18354\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qconvert.gif\"\u003e, select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18355\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e for time, then select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18356\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e for seconds, and then select 4 for days.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_4_50/f-50-4-1-anim.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18357\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18357\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18358\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18358\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator tells us that 151,200 seconds make 1.75 days.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_4_50/f-50-4-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eConvert to a fraction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
